格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Structured, reusable skill modules for AI coding agents — covering engineering workflows, reliability evaluation, and production readiness.","id":"gh:1284582023","install_available":false,"language":null,"name":"dr-agent-skills","slug":"Leeaoyin/dr-agent-skills","topics":["coding","dsh","dsh-plugin","harness-engineering","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Structured, reusable skill modules for AI coding agents — covering engineering workflows, reliabilit"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"y evaluation, and production readiness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A personal repository for collecting, organizing, and reusing Agent Skills."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"This repository stores reusable skills for AI agents, coding agents, document generation agents, cod"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"e review agents, tool-using agents, engineering workflows, context management, and token optimizatio"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"review agents, tool-using agents, engineering workflows, context management, and token optimization."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Each skill is organized as an independent directory with clear usage scenarios, activation condition"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"s, execution procedures, constraints, output requirements, and examples."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Goals"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"This repository is not intended to be a simple prompt collection."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Its purpose is to turn reusable agent workflows into structured, maintainable, and verifiable skills"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ts purpose is to turn reusable agent workflows into structured, maintainable, and verifiable skills."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The main goals are:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"* Capture reusable agent workflows\n* Standardize skill structure and authoring conventions\n* Improve"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" the reliability of coding agents and general-purpose agents\n* Reduce repetitive prompt writing\n* Lo"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"wer unnecessary context token usage\n* Encourage agents to reuse existing tools, frameworks, and proj"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ect capabilities\n* Give complex tasks explicit procedures, boundaries, and failure strategies\n* Prov"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ide reusable capability modules for custom agents, MCP-based agents, and Agent OS designs"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## What Is a Skill?"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"In this repository, a skill is a structured capability definition for a specific class of tasks."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"A skill usually defines:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"* Applicable scenarios\n* Activation conditions\n* Execution procedure\n* Input requirements\n* Output f"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ormat\n* Constraints\n* Tool usage rules\n* Failure strategy\n* Examples\n* Quality checklist"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"A skill is not the same as a one-off prompt. A prompt is usually written for a single interaction, w"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"hile a skill is designed for long-term reuse, engineering consistency, and stable execution."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Repository Structure"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Recommended structure:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Where:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"* `README.md` is the repository-level documentation\n* `*/SKILL.md` is the core rule file used by the"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" agent\n* `*/README.md` is the human-readable explanation for developers and maintainers\n* `reference"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"s/` contains shared templates, authoring guides, checklists, and reference material"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Included Skills"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Framework-first Coding Skill"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Directory:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Constrains a coding agent to inspect and reuse existing framework features, dependencies, SDKs, util"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ities, shared components, and project abstractions before writing custom implementation code."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Suitable for:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"* Adding APIs\n* Fixing bugs\n* Refactoring code\n* Integrating third-party APIs\n* Writing database que"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ries\n* Request validation\n* Authorization handling\n* File upload\n* HTTP calls\n* Logging, caching, sc"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"heduling, and other common engineering tasks"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Core principle:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"This skill helps reduce duplicated implementation, lower token consumption, improve code consistency"},{"id":"p31s2","text":", and increase maintainability."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Agent Harness Evaluation Skill"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Directory:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Systematically evaluates the robustness, reliability, safety, recoverability, context engineering ef"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ficiency, and production readiness of AI Agent Harness implementations through deterministic testing"},{"id":"p36s3","text":", fault injection, chaos scenarios, and reliability metrics."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Suitable for:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"* Building a new Agent framework\n* Reviewing an existing Agent system before release\n* Introducing n"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"ew tools into the harness\n* Changing retry or checkpoint mechanisms\n* Upgrading model providers\n* Ad"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ding multi-agent workflows\n* Measuring prompt cache and context efficiency\n* Preparing for productio"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"gent workflows\n* Measuring prompt cache and context efficiency\n* Preparing for production deployment"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Core principle:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"This skill helps detect reliability gaps before production, prevent duplicate side effects and secur"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ity violations, validate recovery mechanisms, and enforce production gate criteria."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Skill Authoring Convention"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Each skill should normally contain at least two files:"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"### SKILL.md"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"`SKILL.md` is the core file read and executed by the agent. It should be clear, actionable, and conc"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"LL.md` is the core file read and executed by the agent. It should be clear, actionable, and concise."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Recommended structure:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"### README.md"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"`README.md` is written for humans. It can explain the background, purpose, suitable scenarios, behav"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"ior, and examples in more detail."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Recommended structure:"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"## Naming Convention"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"Skill directory names should use lowercase English words and hyphens:"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"Avoid:"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"Naming principles:"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"* Short\n* Clear\n* Searchable\n* Describes the core capability\n* Avoids unnecessary abstraction"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"## Suggested Skill Categories"},{"id":"p61s1","text":"Skills can be grouped by task type."},{"id":"p62s1","text":"### Coding Skills"},{"id":"p63s1","text":"For code generation, modification, refactoring, and review."},{"id":"p64s1","text":"Examples:"},{"id":"p65s1","text":"* `framework-first-coding`\n* `minimal-patch-coding`\n* `code-review`\n* `security-review`\n* `test-firs"},{"id":"p65s2","text":"t-coding`\n* `dependency-inspection`\n* `project-convention-following`"},{"id":"p66s1","text":"### Agent Skills"},{"id":"p67s1","text":"For agent execution flow, tool use, and task orchestration."},{"id":"p68s1","text":"Examples:"},{"id":"p69s1","text":"* `tool-use-planning`\n* `tool-failure-strategy`\n* `multi-step-task-execution`\n* `human-in-the-loop`\n"},{"id":"p69s2","text":"* `agent-loop-control`\n* `context-compaction`"},{"id":"p70s1","text":"### Document Skills"},{"id":"p71s1","text":"For creating, editing, summarizing, and structuring documents."},{"id":"p72s1","text":"Examples:"},{"id":"p73s1","text":"* `document-generation`\n* `technical-report-writing`\n* `research-summary`\n* `docx-processing`\n* `sli"},{"id":"p73s2","text":"de-generation`\n* `proposal-writing`"},{"id":"p74s1","text":"### As Capability Modules for Custom Agents"},{"id":"p75s1","text":"In a custom agent system, a skill can be loaded as a capability declaration or strategy module:"},{"id":"p76s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
